# Built by tools\dlg_day_hooks.py from tools\dlg_day_hooks.txt: edit that file, not this one.

@rule day.h.fine_quiet
on day
when mood=none
hook fine_quiet
opens ask,share,tease
- It's been pretty normal. Just a regular day.
- Nothing special, really. Classes, friends, the usual.
- Quiet so far. Nothing's happened yet.
- No drama today. That's rare.
- Nothing to complain about. I'll take it.

@rule move.h.fine_quiet.ask
on move.ask
when hook=fine_quiet
- Ask if anything good happened at all

@rule react.h.fine_quiet.ask
on react
when hook=fine_quiet move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Hm... the bread at lunch was still warm. That's about it.
- Nope. If something happens, you'll be the first to know.
- Not yet. It's usually after class when things get interesting.

@rule move.h.fine_quiet.share
on move.share
when hook=fine_quiet
- Say your day's been quiet too

@rule react.h.fine_quiet.share
on react
when hook=fine_quiet move=share fit=good|neutral
- So we're both boring. That's kind of comforting.
- Then we can be boring together.
- Good. I thought it was just me.

@rule move.h.fine_quiet.tease
on move.tease
when hook=fine_quiet
- Say she must be bored to death

@rule react.h.fine_quiet.tease
on react
when hook=fine_quiet move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Hey, quiet days are underrated!
- Careful, or I'll make something up just to shut you up.
- I'm fine with boring, thank you very much.

@rule day.h.fine_routine
on day
when mood=none
hook fine_routine
opens ask,share,tease
- I took notes, I ate, I looked out the window. That's the whole story.
- Class, lunch, class. Thrilling stuff.
- Same as always. The bell rings, I sit down, the bell rings, I stand up.
- I sat through class and looked out the window a lot.

@rule move.h.fine_routine.ask
on move.ask
when hook=fine_routine
- Ask what's so good out the window

@rule react.h.fine_routine.ask
on react
when hook=fine_routine move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A cat on the wall. It looked happier than all of us.
- Clouds. One looked like a shoe.
- The track team. And a very slow bird.

@rule move.h.fine_routine.share
on move.share
when hook=fine_routine
- Say your class was just as dull

@rule react.h.fine_routine.share
on react
when hook=fine_routine move=share fit=good|neutral
- Then we were probably bored at the same time.
- So it's the whole school, not just me.
- At least you get it.

@rule move.h.fine_routine.tease
on move.tease
when hook=fine_routine
- Applaud her thrilling story

@rule react.h.fine_routine.tease
on react
when hook=fine_routine move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Thank you. The sequel comes out tomorrow.
- Hey! I told it as well as it could be told.
- Ha. You want drama, go find it yourself.

@rule day.h.fine_forgot
on day
when mood=none
hook fine_forgot
opens ask,share,tease
- I think I forgot something at home, but otherwise fine.
- I keep feeling like I forgot something today.
- I left the house with this feeling I forgot something. It's bugging me.

@rule move.h.fine_forgot.ask
on move.ask
when hook=fine_forgot
- Ask what she forgot

@rule react.h.fine_forgot.ask
on react
when hook=fine_forgot move=ask fit=good|neutral
- If I knew, I wouldn't have forgotten it. It's going to bother me all day.
- Wait. No. Maybe. Now you've got me thinking.
- My keys? No, I have those. Hm.

@rule move.h.fine_forgot.share
on move.share
when hook=fine_forgot
- Say that happens to you all the time

@rule react.h.fine_forgot.share
on react
when hook=fine_forgot move=share fit=good|neutral
- Good, I'm not losing it, then.
- And do you ever remember what it was?
- Is it the air in this school?

@rule move.h.fine_forgot.tease
on move.tease
when hook=fine_forgot
- Ask if she remembers your name

@rule react.h.fine_forgot.tease
on react
when hook=fine_forgot move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Unfortunately, yes.
- Very funny. Of course I remember you.
- I'll remember this, at least.

@rule day.h.cheerful_luck
on day
when mood=cheerful
hook cheerful_luck
opens ask,share,tease
feel smile
- I found money in an old coat! Little things, you know?
- I got the last melon bread. Today's a winner.
- The vending machine gave me two drinks for one! Lucky day!
- Everything's going my way today.

@rule move.h.cheerful_luck.ask
on move.ask
when hook=cheerful_luck
- Ask how she got so lucky

@rule react.h.cheerful_luck.ask
on react
when hook=cheerful_luck move=ask fit=good|neutral
- I don't know, but I'm not questioning it.
- Clean living. Or luck. Probably luck.
- No idea! I should buy a lottery ticket.

@rule move.h.cheerful_luck.share
on move.share
when hook=cheerful_luck
- Say her luck is rubbing off on you

@rule react.h.cheerful_luck.share
on react
when hook=cheerful_luck move=share fit=good|neutral
- Stay close, then. There's plenty.
- Hehe, you're welcome.
- Then you owe me a thank you.

@rule move.h.cheerful_luck.tease
on move.tease
when hook=cheerful_luck
- Ask for a share of the luck

@rule react.h.cheerful_luck.tease
on react
when hook=cheerful_luck move=tease fit=good|neutral
- You can have the crumbs.
- Ha! Nice try. Okay, a little.
- Luck doesn't work like that. Pay up with a smile.

@rule day.h.cheerful_noreason
on day
when mood=cheerful
hook cheerful_noreason
opens ask,praise,tease
feel smile
- I'm in such a good mood today. Can you tell?
- Everyone keeps asking why I'm smiling. I can't help it.
- I've been smiling all day for no reason. Don't laugh.
- I almost skipped down the hallway. That's how good I feel.

@rule move.h.cheerful_noreason.ask
on move.ask
when hook=cheerful_noreason
- Ask why she's in such a good mood

@rule react.h.cheerful_noreason.ask
on react
when hook=cheerful_noreason move=ask fit=good|neutral
- No reason. Isn't that the best kind?
- Promise you won't laugh? I just slept really well.
- I don't even know! It's just one of those days.

@rule move.h.cheerful_noreason.praise
on move.praise
when hook=cheerful_noreason
- Say the smile suits her

@rule react.h.cheerful_noreason.praise
on react
when hook=cheerful_noreason move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Oh... stop it. Now I'm smiling even more.
- You'd better not say that to everyone.
- Thank you. That's going straight on today's list.

@rule move.h.cheerful_noreason.tease
on move.tease
when hook=cheerful_noreason
- Say it's a little scary

@rule react.h.cheerful_noreason.tease
on react
when hook=cheerful_noreason move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Hey! You're just jealous.
- Be afraid. Good moods are contagious.
- Ha! Too bad, I'm not stopping.

@rule day.h.cheerful_news
on day
when mood=cheerful
hook cheerful_news
opens ask,share,tease
feel smile
- Something good happened this morning. I'm trying not to smile too much.
- I got good news. Guess what I'm thinking about.
- I want to tell somebody, and here you are. Good timing.
- I was hoping to run into someone. I've got good news.

@rule move.h.cheerful_news.ask
on move.ask
when hook=cheerful_news
- Ask what the good news is

@rule react.h.cheerful_news.ask
on react
when hook=cheerful_news move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Okay, okay. It's small, but something I worked on finally paid off.
- I can't say yet, but soon. Ask me next week.
- It's a secret for one more day. I just wanted someone to notice.

@rule move.h.cheerful_news.share
on move.share
when hook=cheerful_news
- Say you could use some good news

@rule react.h.cheerful_news.share
on react
when hook=cheerful_news move=share fit=good|neutral
- Then I'll lend you half of mine.
- Me too, before today.
- Stick with me. It's a good day for it.

@rule move.h.cheerful_news.tease
on move.tease
when hook=cheerful_news
- Guess she won the lottery

@rule react.h.cheerful_news.tease
on react
when hook=cheerful_news move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Ha! No! Not even close.
- If I had, would I still be at school?
- Keep guessing. It's funny.

@rule day.h.hungry_starving
on day
when mood=hungry
hook hungry_starving
opens invite,share,tease
fit tease=neutral invite=neutral
- Honestly? I'm starving. I skipped breakfast.
- My stomach has been growling all class.
- My stomach is louder than the teacher.
- I'm so hungry I can't think. If I faint, tell my family I tried.

@rule move.h.hungry_starving.invite
on move.invite
when hook=hungry_starving
- Offer to go eat with her

@rule react.h.hungry_starving.invite
on react
when hook=hungry_starving move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Really? You just became my favorite person.
- Yes. Now. Before I change my mind about being polite.
- You're saving a life, you know that?

@rule move.h.hungry_starving.share
on move.share
when hook=hungry_starving
- Offer her the snack in your bag

@rule react.h.hungry_starving.share
on react
when hook=hungry_starving move=share fit=good|neutral
- You had food this whole time?! Thank you!
- Oh, you're a real one. Thank you.
- I could hug that snack. Thank you.

@rule move.h.hungry_starving.tease
on move.tease
when hook=hungry_starving
- Say you can hear her stomach from here

@rule react.h.hungry_starving.tease
on react
when hook=hungry_starving move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Don't. It heard you. It's getting worse.
- Hey! It has feelings, you know.
- I hope you're proud of yourself.

@rule day.h.hungry_nolunch
on day
when mood=hungry
hook hungry_nolunch
opens invite,ask,tease
feel sad
fit tease=neutral invite=neutral
- My lunch money's gone. Today's a tragedy.
- I forgot my bento at home. This is the worst.
- I left my lunch on the kitchen table. I can see it in my mind.
- I've got no lunch today. Not one crumb.

@rule move.h.hungry_nolunch.invite
on move.invite
when hook=hungry_nolunch
- Offer to treat her today

@rule react.h.hungry_nolunch.invite
on react
when hook=hungry_nolunch move=invite fit=good|neutral
- You mean it? I'll pay you back, I swear.
- I could cry. Don't look.
- You're my hero. Don't let it go to your head.

@rule move.h.hungry_nolunch.ask
on move.ask
when hook=hungry_nolunch
- Ask what she'll do for food

@rule react.h.hungry_nolunch.ask
on react
when hook=hungry_nolunch move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Suffer, mostly. Unless someone drops a sandwich.
- Drink a lot of water and pretend.
