@rule move.h.hungry_nolunch.tease
on move.tease
when hook=hungry_nolunch
- Offer her an eraser to snack on

@rule react.h.hungry_nolunch.tease
on react
when hook=hungry_nolunch move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I'm hungry enough to consider it.
