@rule day.h.hungry_smell
on day
when mood=hungry
hook hungry_smell
opens invite,ask,tease
fit tease=neutral invite=neutral
- I can smell the cafeteria from here. It's torture.
- Someone was eating yakisoba bread right in front of me. I nearly cried.
- The smell from the cafeteria followed me up the stairs. All I can think about is food.

@rule move.h.hungry_smell.invite
on move.invite
when hook=hungry_smell
- Suggest going to the cafeteria now

@rule react.h.hungry_smell.invite
on react
when hook=hungry_smell move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Yes. Walk fast.
- Finally, someone with good ideas.
- Lead the way. Actually, I'll lead. I know the smell.

@rule move.h.hungry_smell.ask
on move.ask
when hook=hungry_smell
- Ask what she's craving

@rule react.h.hungry_smell.ask
on react
when hook=hungry_smell move=ask fit=good|neutral
