- Curry. No, ramen. No, both.
- Bread. Warm bread. Don't make me say more.

@rule move.h.hungry_smell.tease
on move.tease
when hook=hungry_smell
- Pretend to eat something in front of her

@rule react.h.hungry_smell.tease
on react
when hook=hungry_smell move=tease fit=good|neutral
