@rule day.h.lunch_ready
on day
when mood=hungry period=lunch
hook lunch_ready
opens invite,ask,tease
feel smile
fit tease=neutral invite=neutral
- Finally, lunch. I've been waiting for this all morning.
- Lunch! I'm going to eat so much.
- I've planned this lunch since second period. Don't judge the amount.
- Thank god, lunch. Don't get between me and the food.

@rule move.h.lunch_ready.invite
on move.invite
when hook=lunch_ready
- Ask if you can eat with her

@rule react.h.lunch_ready.invite
on react
when hook=lunch_ready move=invite fit=good|neutral
