- Good. Bring your own, I'm not sharing. Okay, maybe a little.
- Yes! Let's go before the line gets long.

@rule move.h.lunch_ready.ask
on move.ask
when hook=lunch_ready
- Ask what she's getting

@rule react.h.lunch_ready.ask
on react
when hook=lunch_ready move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Yakisoba bread, a croquette and milk. It's a system.
- All of it.
- You'll see. Don't count.

@rule move.h.lunch_ready.tease
on move.tease
when hook=lunch_ready
- Say you'll take the last bread

@rule react.h.lunch_ready.tease
on react
when hook=lunch_ready move=tease fit=good|neutral
