@rule day.h.bored_clock
on day
when mood=bored
hook bored_clock
opens ask,invite,tease
fit tease=neutral
- Every class felt three hours long. I've been staring at the clock all day.
- I think the clock's going backward. Help.
- Slow. So slow. Today's never going to end.
- If this day were a movie, I'd have left already.

@rule move.h.bored_clock.ask
on move.ask
when hook=bored_clock
- Ask which class was the worst

@rule react.h.bored_clock.ask
on react
when hook=bored_clock move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Ethics. Or maybe all of them.
- The one after lunch. It never ends.
- Math. The teacher read from the book. All of it.

@rule move.h.bored_clock.invite
on move.invite
when hook=bored_clock
- Suggest doing something after class

@rule react.h.bored_clock.invite
on react
when hook=bored_clock move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Now you're talking. Where?
- Please. I'll follow you anywhere that isn't this room.
- Finally, a plan.

@rule move.h.bored_clock.tease
on move.tease
when hook=bored_clock
- Say looking at the clock makes it slower

@rule react.h.bored_clock.tease
on react
when hook=bored_clock move=tease fit=good|neutral
