@rule day.h.bored_doodles
on day
when mood=bored
hook bored_doodles
opens ask,praise,tease
fit tease=neutral praise=good
- I counted the ceiling tiles. Twice. There are a lot.
- I tried to balance an eraser on my nose. That's how bad it is.
- I've been spinning my pen for an hour. I'm getting good at it.
- I've found new ways to waste time in class. It's that kind of day.

@rule move.h.bored_doodles.ask
on move.ask
when hook=bored_doodles
- Ask how she passes the time

@rule react.h.bored_doodles.ask
on react
