@rule day.h.bored_entertain
on day
when mood=bored
hook bored_entertain
opens invite,share,tease
fit tease=neutral
- I'm bored out of my mind. Entertain me?
- Tell me you're here to do something interesting.
- Everyone's half dead today. Please do something fun.
- Please tell me something happened somewhere. Anything.

@rule move.h.bored_entertain.invite
on move.invite
when hook=bored_entertain
- Suggest doing something fun

@rule react.h.bored_entertain.invite
on react
when hook=bored_entertain move=invite fit=good|neutral
