@rule day.h.stressed_todo
on day
when mood=stressed
hook stressed_todo
opens comfort,ask,invite
feel worried
- Kind of rough. I've got so much to do.
- Not great. My to-do list keeps growing.
- I keep making lists, and the lists make it worse.
- I wrote everything down, and it's so much. I don't know where to start.

@rule move.h.stressed_todo.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=stressed_todo
- Say she doesn't have to do it all today

@rule react.h.stressed_todo.comfort
on react
when hook=stressed_todo move=comfort fit=good|neutral
