- Today? More than I can fit. Tomorrow's worse.

@rule move.h.stressed_todo.invite
on move.invite
when hook=stressed_todo
- Offer to help her with it

@rule react.h.stressed_todo.invite
on react
when hook=stressed_todo move=invite fit=good|neutral
