@rule move.h.stressed_worry.ask
on move.ask
when hook=stressed_worry
- Ask what worries her most about it

@rule react.h.stressed_worry.ask
on react
when hook=stressed_worry move=ask fit=good|neutral
- That I'll let people down. That's the honest answer.
- I don't know, that's the worst part.
- It's not one thing. It just keeps piling up.

@rule move.h.stressed_worry.invite
on move.invite
when hook=stressed_worry
- Suggest a walk to clear her head

@rule react.h.stressed_worry.invite
on react
when hook=stressed_worry move=invite fit=good|neutral
