@rule move.h.stressed_mask.invite
on move.invite
when hook=stressed_mask
- Offer to hide somewhere with her for a bit

@rule react.h.stressed_mask.invite
on react
when hook=stressed_mask move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Yes. Somewhere nobody can find me.
- That's the kindest offer I've had all day.
