- Tell that to them. ...Thanks.
- You make it sound easy. It helps, though.

@rule move.h.stressed_favors.ask
on move.ask
when hook=stressed_favors
- Ask who keeps asking her for things

@rule react.h.stressed_favors.ask
on react
when hook=stressed_favors move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Everyone. Classmates, teachers. They mean well.
- Whoever finds me first.
- It'd be faster to list who hasn't.

@rule move.h.stressed_favors.tease
on move.tease
when hook=stressed_favors
- Ask her to do one more little thing

@rule react.h.stressed_favors.tease
on react
when hook=stressed_favors move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I will end you.
- Don't. Even.
- Ha. ...Ha. I hate you a little.

@rule day.h.exam_blank
on day
when mood=stressed exam=yes
hook exam_blank
opens comfort,ask,invite
feel worried
- The exams. I studied all night and I still feel like I know nothing.
- I keep blanking on everything. I'm doomed.
- I've read this chapter five times. Nothing's sticking.
- I memorized it this morning and it's already gone.

@rule move.h.exam_blank.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=exam_blank
- Say she knows more than she thinks

@rule react.h.exam_blank.comfort
on react
when hook=exam_blank move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- You sound so sure. I wish I were.
- Maybe it's in there somewhere. Thanks.
- I'll hold on to that.

@rule move.h.exam_blank.ask
on move.ask
when hook=exam_blank
- Ask which subject is the problem

@rule react.h.exam_blank.ask
on react
when hook=exam_blank move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Math. No, history. No, everything with numbers.
- All of them, but mostly the one tomorrow.
- The second half of the book. It just slides off my brain.

@rule move.h.exam_blank.invite
on move.invite
when hook=exam_blank
- Offer to study together

@rule react.h.exam_blank.invite
on react
when hook=exam_blank move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Would you? Yes. Please.
- Okay, but don't laugh at my answers.
- Two heads might hold more than one.

@rule day.h.exam_panic
on day
when mood=stressed exam=yes
hook exam_panic
opens comfort,ask,share
feel worried
- Everyone in class is pretending not to panic. Me included.
- The whole room smells like fear and highlighters.
- I'm so nervous about the exams I can't sit still.
- I dreamed about the exam. I got it wrong.

@rule move.h.exam_panic.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=exam_panic
- Say everyone's scared too

@rule react.h.exam_panic.comfort
on react
when hook=exam_panic move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- That actually helps. A little.
- You're right. Nobody looks okay.
- Okay. Then I'm not the only one.

@rule move.h.exam_panic.ask
on move.ask
when hook=exam_panic
- Ask how she's sleeping

@rule react.h.exam_panic.ask
on react
when hook=exam_panic move=ask fit=good|neutral
- What's that?
- I dream about question ten.
- Badly. Thanks for asking.

@rule move.h.exam_panic.share
on move.share
when hook=exam_panic
- Admit you're scared too

@rule react.h.exam_panic.share
on react
when hook=exam_panic move=share fit=good|neutral
- You? Really? I feel better and I'm sorry about it.
- Then we can sink together.
- Okay. It's not just me, then.

@rule day.h.exam_quiz
on day
when mood=stressed exam=yes
hook exam_quiz
opens share,ask,invite
- Exam week is killing me. Are you ready?
- Everyone's panicking. How are you so calm?
- Did you finish the review sheet? Tell me you did.
- How's your studying going? Be honest. Don't be honest.

@rule move.h.exam_quiz.share
on move.share
when hook=exam_quiz
- Tell her how your studying is going

@rule react.h.exam_quiz.share
on react
when hook=exam_quiz move=share fit=good|neutral
- That's better than mine. I hate you a little.
- Okay, I can beat that. Maybe.
- Then we're in the same boat.

@rule move.h.exam_quiz.ask
on move.ask
when hook=exam_quiz
- Ask how her review is going

@rule react.h.exam_quiz.ask
on react
when hook=exam_quiz move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Half done. The bad half is left.
- Don't ask. No, you can ask. It's bad.
- I stopped looking at the score.

@rule move.h.exam_quiz.invite
on move.invite
when hook=exam_quiz
- Suggest reviewing together

@rule react.h.exam_quiz.invite
on react
when hook=exam_quiz move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Yes. Library, after class?
- Good idea. You check mine, I'll check yours.
- Bring snacks and we have a deal.

@rule day.h.stressed_club
on day
when mood=stressed period=after|club
hook stressed_club
opens comfort,ask,invite
feel worried
- The {club} is a mess right now. We're behind on everything.
- Half the {club} didn't show up. So it's all on me.
- We've got a deadline at the {club}. I can't do it alone.
- Nobody's doing their part at the {club}.

@rule move.h.stressed_club.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=stressed_club
- Say it's not all on her

@rule react.h.stressed_club.comfort
on react
when hook=stressed_club move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- I wish they'd tell me that.
- Hearing that from you helps.
- Doesn't feel like it, but thanks.

@rule move.h.stressed_club.ask
on move.ask
when hook=stressed_club
- Ask what's left to do

@rule react.h.stressed_club.ask
on react
when hook=stressed_club move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Everything, basically. Ask me which part isn't a disaster.
- It's not even hard work, there's just so much of it.
- More than we have days for.

@rule move.h.stressed_club.invite
on move.invite
when hook=stressed_club
- Offer to lend a hand

@rule react.h.stressed_club.invite
on react
when hook=stressed_club move=invite fit=good|neutral
- You'd do that? Okay. I owe you.
- I'll take any help I can get.
- Careful, I might say yes.

@rule day.h.stressed_clubdoubt
on day
when mood=stressed period=after|club
hook stressed_clubdoubt
opens comfort,ask,share
feel worried
- I used to love the {club}. It's not fun lately.
- I joined the {club} to have fun, you know? What happened?
- The {club} feels like a job lately. I want to run away.

@rule move.h.stressed_clubdoubt.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=stressed_clubdoubt
- Say a bad patch doesn't change that

@rule react.h.stressed_clubdoubt.comfort
on react
when hook=stressed_clubdoubt move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- Maybe it comes back. I hope so.
- I needed to hear that.
- Thank you. I'm not sure I believe it yet.

@rule move.h.stressed_clubdoubt.ask
on move.ask
when hook=stressed_clubdoubt
- Ask when it stopped being fun

@rule react.h.stressed_clubdoubt.ask
on react
when hook=stressed_clubdoubt move=ask fit=good|neutral
- When it turned into a list of things to do.
- I don't know. That's what scares me.
- Around the time people stopped laughing.

@rule move.h.stressed_clubdoubt.share
on move.share
when hook=stressed_clubdoubt
- Say you've felt like quitting things too

@rule react.h.stressed_clubdoubt.share
on react
when hook=stressed_clubdoubt move=share fit=good|neutral
- So it's normal. Good to know.
- What did you do? No, don't tell me yet.
- Thanks for not telling me to just cheer up.

@rule day.h.lonely_alone
on day
when mood=lonely
hook lonely_alone
opens comfort,ask,invite
feel sad
- Kind of lonely, actually. I ate by myself.
- My friends were all busy today.
- It's been a long day by myself.
- I haven't really talked to anyone today. Until now, I guess.

@rule move.h.lonely_alone.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=lonely_alone
- Say you'll keep her company

@rule react.h.lonely_alone.comfort
on react
when hook=lonely_alone move=comfort fit=good|neutral
