- Okay. Stay a little, then.
- That helps. Really.

@rule move.h.lonely_alone.ask
on move.ask
when hook=lonely_alone
- Ask where her friends went

@rule react.h.lonely_alone.ask
on react
when hook=lonely_alone move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Clubs, boyfriends, who knows. Everyone had somewhere to be.
- They're around. They just didn't look for me.
- I didn't ask. It felt like asking for too much.

@rule move.h.lonely_alone.invite
on move.invite
when hook=lonely_alone
- Ask her to eat with you next time

@rule react.h.lonely_alone.invite
on react
when hook=lonely_alone move=invite fit=good|neutral
