- I'd like that. A lot.
- Okay. Don't forget, now.

@rule day.h.lonely_oddone
on day
when mood=lonely
hook lonely_oddone
opens comfort,ask,invite
feel sad
- Everyone paired up in class but me. It's fine.
- I ended up the odd one out in group work. It happens.
- We had to get into groups today, and I was left over.

@rule move.h.lonely_oddone.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=lonely_oddone
