@rule react.h.lonely_oddone.comfort
on react
when hook=lonely_oddone move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...It did bother me. Thanks for noticing.
- You don't have to say that. But thank you.
- Okay. Maybe it matters a little.

@rule move.h.lonely_oddone.ask
on move.ask
when hook=lonely_oddone
- Ask what happened in group work

@rule react.h.lonely_oddone.ask
on react
when hook=lonely_oddone move=ask fit=good|neutral
