- ...Yes. I'd like that.
- Okay. I'll look for you.

@rule day.h.lonely_invisible
on day
when mood=lonely
hook lonely_invisible
opens comfort,share,ask
feel sad
- The classroom feels big when nobody talks to you.
- Break time is long when you're alone.
- Do you ever feel invisible? Today's like that.
- You're the first person I've really talked to today. That's a little embarrassing.

@rule move.h.lonely_invisible.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=lonely_invisible
