- I'll hold you to that.
- Yes. Please.

@rule day.h.lonely_needyou
on day
when mood=lonely rel=girlfriend|lover
hook lonely_needyou
opens invite,comfort,ask
feel sad
- Are you free after school? I don't want to go alone.
- Can we walk home together? Please?
- Stay with me after class today. I don't want to be by myself.

@rule move.h.lonely_needyou.invite
on move.invite
when hook=lonely_needyou
