- Oh, you're in trouble now.
- Hmph. Try again tomorrow.

@rule day.h.flirty_daydream
on day
when mood=flirty
hook flirty_daydream
opens ask,tease,invite
feel smile
- I can't focus on class today. Guess what about.
- I've been daydreaming all morning. Your fault, maybe.
- My mind keeps wandering today, and I know exactly where to.

@rule move.h.flirty_daydream.ask
on move.ask
when hook=flirty_daydream
- Ask what she was daydreaming about

@rule react.h.flirty_daydream.ask
on react
when hook=flirty_daydream move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Mm. You'll have to earn that.
