- That's a good excuse to see you later.

@rule day.h.sleepy_latenight
on day
when mood=sleepy
hook sleepy_latenight
opens ask,share,tease
fit tease=neutral
- I stayed up way too late last night.
- I was watching videos until three. Don't tell me off.
- I just couldn't put my phone down. One more, I said.
- Last night was a mistake. I need a nap, badly.

@rule move.h.sleepy_latenight.ask
on move.ask
when hook=sleepy_latenight
- Ask what kept her up

@rule react.h.sleepy_latenight.ask
on react
when hook=sleepy_latenight move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Cat videos. Then how bridges are built. I don't know how.
- One more episode, then one more after that.
- I honestly can't remember the last hour.

@rule move.h.sleepy_latenight.share
on move.share
when hook=sleepy_latenight
- Admit you stayed up too

@rule react.h.sleepy_latenight.share
on react
when hook=sleepy_latenight move=share fit=good|neutral
