- Then why do you look fine? Unfair.
- Good. We're both idiots.

@rule move.h.sleepy_latenight.tease
on move.tease
when hook=sleepy_latenight
- Tell her off anyway

@rule react.h.sleepy_latenight.tease
on react
when hook=sleepy_latenight move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I said don't!
- You sound like my mother.
- I know, I know. Tomorrow I'll be good.

@rule day.h.sleepy_class
on day
when mood=sleepy
hook sleepy_class
opens ask,share,tease
fit tease=neutral
- I almost fell asleep in class.
- The teacher caught me nodding off.
- My notes turn into squiggles after the first line. I can't read them.
- I wrote half my notes in a straight line down the page.

@rule move.h.sleepy_class.ask
on move.ask
when hook=sleepy_class
