- Don't you dare tell anyone.
- That was someone else. Definitely.

@rule day.h.sleepy_fading
on day
when mood=sleepy
hook sleepy_fading
opens invite,ask,tease
fit tease=neutral
- Coffee didn't work. Say something loud.
- I've been pinching myself awake. Help.
- My eyes keep closing. Talk slowly.
- If I lean on you, don't take it personally. I'm fading.

@rule move.h.sleepy_fading.invite
on move.invite
when hook=sleepy_fading
- Offer to get her a coffee

@rule react.h.sleepy_fading.invite
on react
when hook=sleepy_fading move=invite fit=good|neutral
